

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Conventional Commits  (https://www.conventionalcommits.org)
#
#   <type>(<scope>): <short summary>          <- 72 chars max, imperative mood
#   <blank line>
#   <body>                                     <- what and why, not how
#   <blank line>
#   <footer>                                   <- BREAKING CHANGE:, Closes #12
#
# type:   feat | fix | docs | style | refactor | perf | test | build | ci | chore | revert
# scope:  backend | frontend | ml | infra | docs | repo   (optional)
#
# Examples:
#   feat(ml): add python implementation of specan acoustic features
#   fix(backend): reject uploads larger than 10 MB
#   docs(repo): document local setup for windows
#
# Lines starting with '#' are ignored.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
